## Marketing website (SleepfactorWebsite)

Separate repo, static site (e.g. GitHub Pages). After changes:

```bash
cd /path/to/SleepfactorWebsite
python3 -m http.server 8000   # or npx serve .
# Open http://localhost:8000 — check favicon, Home, About, Privacy, nav, cookie banner, narrow viewport
git add .
git commit -m "Short description"
git push origin main
```

**Smoke test live** GitHub Pages URL after deploy.

