## Quick command reference

```bash
# Feature work
git checkout -b feature/your-feature-name

# Dev testing
npx expo start --dev-client --tunnel
npx expo start --dev-client --lan

# Rebuild dev clients (native changes)
npx eas-cli build --platform android --profile development
npx eas-cli build --platform ios --profile development --clear-cache

# iOS TestFlight / App Store binary
eas build --platform ios --profile production
eas submit --platform ios --latest

# Credentials (Expo)
npx eas-cli credentials -p ios
```

**Android production APK:** After merge to **`main`**, use the repo’s **GitHub Actions** release artifact / **Releases** page (URL depends on org — replace placeholders in older docs with your real repo).

