## Daily summary for LLMs

| Stage | Action |
|-------|--------|
| Dev | Branch → **SleepFactor Dev** + `expo start --dev-client` (tunnel/LAN) |
| Merge | PR → **`main`** → Android **APK** workflow (if enabled) |
| iOS beta | **`eas build` production iOS** → **`eas submit`** → **TestFlight** groups |
| Website | **SleepfactorWebsite** local serve → push → Pages smoke test |

When advising **how to test**, state whether behavior should match **iOS and Android** or is **platform-specific** (per **`IOS-Android-testing.mdc`**).
